00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.009
In this video I'll be giving an example
of a non-rational number. if the square

00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:09.330
root of two were rational number then by
definition it must be expressed as the

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:14.670
ratio of two integers. If we then square
both sides we have two equals a squared

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:20.160
divided by B squared. If we multiply both
sides by b square root of 2 b

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.990
squared equals A squared and from this
we know that A squared is even. A squared

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:30.269
is even because we have two times some
integer which is B squared. Since A

00:00:30.269 --> 00:00:35.160
squared is even, we know that is even
because a squared equals two times a

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:40.079
manager the integer I chose was 2k
squared that means that a times a can be

00:00:40.079 --> 00:00:45.570
expressed as 2k x 2k which is to say
that A equals 2K. I can now substitute

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:52.829
2 x 2k squared or A squared and that
leaves us with B squared equals 2K

00:00:52.829 --> 00:00:58.109
squared once these twos cancel out. Now, this also means that B squared is even

00:00:58.109 --> 00:01:02.219
because b squared equals 2 times some
integer which is to say that B is also

00:01:02.219 --> 00:01:09.420
even, following this same logic. Now we go back to our original premise the square

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:16.740
root of 2 equals A divided by B where a
divided by B is an irreducible fraction.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:24.689
But since A is an even number and B is
also an even number we can express these

00:01:24.689 --> 00:01:30.329
numbers as 2k and 2L. But these 2s
here will reduce meaning that will have

00:01:30.329 --> 00:01:36.360
the square root of 2 equals K / L but
since this reduced since this is no

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:40.960
longer explicitly represented as A
divided by B and it reduced to

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:46.799
K / L we know that we do not have a
rational number. Now, there's a more

00:01:46.799 --> 00:01:53.009
specific way to define these numbers or
classify these numbers but we need set

00:01:53.009 --> 00:01:54.420
operators in the next video

